@node "Hist-October96" "October 96"
@{b}@{fg shine}________________________________________________________________________@{ub}@{fg text}

@{b}History                                                   October 1996@{ub}
@{b}________________________________________________________________________@{ub}

@{b}20/10/96 - Sunday - Version 0.01@{ub}

    Developement started after playing around with FAME and ByteKiller


During these 7 days I wrote all the basic funtions:
    File Commenting
    Message Sending
    etc...


@{b}27/10/96 - Sunday - Version 0.02@{ub}

    Added a configuration file - only holds the location to a @{"comments file" link "Config-CommentsFile" 0}
    so far, but it's ready for use for anything else!

@{b}31/10/96 - Thursday - Version 0.03@{ub}

    Hmmm.. I hadn't done much work on this in the last few days, too busy
    writing a chat program to be used at my college computer network.
    That'll teach the computing staff from disabling the built in chat
    programs ;)

    Erm, anyway!  I've finally implemented the File Announcement fuction.
    It only took me a few minutes so I don't know why I didn't do it before!
    Also, it's message area is the second thing that goes in the
    Configuration file, using the keyword @{"ANNOUNCEAREA" link "Config-AnnouceArea" 0}.
@endnode

@node "Hist-November96" "November 96"
@{b}@{fg shine}________________________________________________________________________@{ub}@{fg text}

@{b}History                                                  November 1996@{ub}
@{b}________________________________________________________________________@{ub}

@{b}10/11/96 - Sunday - Version 0.04@{ub}

    Done various things over the last few days, but today I added a simple
    table to the exit routine, just showing a few stats on what you've
    done during the session.
@endnode

@node "Hist-December96" "History - December 96"
@{b}@{fg shine}________________________________________________________________________@{ub}@{fg text}

@{b}History                                                  December 1996@{ub}
@{b}________________________________________________________________________@{ub}

@{b}4/12/96 - Wednesday - Version 0.10@{ub}

    I've been busy over the last month or so, so I've only just got around
    to doing some more on my various projects. What this version is
    basically, is the same as before, but minus the file credit
    giving/taking. I just can't find a way to do it through ARexx in Zeus.
    Oh well :(

@{b}9/12/96 - Monday - Version 0.11@{ub}

    Just a few bug fixes, and changes to the docs.

    I'm getting pretty fed up of the butt ugly interface though, I'll change
    that the moment I get some extra time.

@{b}9/12/96 - Monday - Version 0.12@{ub}

    Second revision today; made the message area for sending the user
    messages configurable. See @{"USERMSGAREA" link "Config-USERMSGAREA" 0}.
@endnode

@node "Hist-April97" "History - April 97"
@{b}@{fg shine}________________________________________________________________________@{ub}@{fg text}

@{b}History                                                  December 1996@{ub}
@{b}________________________________________________________________________@{ub}

@{b}8/4/97 - Tuesday - Version 0.13@{ub}

    User configurable 'file announce' text. (Maybe I'll redo it properly
    later (with %FILE %DESC like commands) - right now it takes the
    message text and appends the file name & description on later..)

@{b}9/4/97 - Wednesday - Version 0.14@ - Release 1.0{ub}

    Made a little neater for release. Someone somewhere must be able to
    get some use out of this program, and I've been sitting on it for
    long enough :)

@{b}23/4/97 - Wednesday - Version 1.15 - Release 1.1@{ub}

    Not much really, I just looked around the code fixing little things,
    and also updated the documents (references to ZeusNet mainly).
    The main reason for making this release is so I can hatch it in
    the AmigaNet ZEUS_UTILS echo as it seems some people didn't get
    the first release.
@endnode

